# C++ library - full project (code + testing + build + tooling + CI). A reusable static
# library with a public API under include/ and no binary of its own. Consumers use git
# submodule + add_subdirectory, so there is no install()/export()/find_package()
# packaging and no Docker release matrix; see cmake-lib and workflows-lib. There is no
# functional layer, having no binary to spawn; unit is always present, and integration
# and fuzz apply where the project earns them. Use cpp-lib-cli if it also ships a CLI.
